#. Format arguments: {0}: string.Join(", ", policyWarnings)
#: Controllers/AdminController.cs
#, csharp-format
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Cors.Controllers.AdminController"
msgid "Specifying AllowAnyOrigin and AllowCredentials is an insecure configuration and can result in cross-site request forgery. The CORS service returns an invalid CORS response when an app is configured with both methods.<br /><strong>Affected policies: {0} </strong><br />Refer to docs: <a href='https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/security/cors' target='_blank'>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/security/cors</a>."
msgstr "Die Angabe von AllowAnyOrigin und AllowCredentials ist eine unsichere Konfiguration und kann zu Cross-Site-Request-Forgery führen. Der CORS-Dienst gibt eine ungültige CORS-Antwort zurück, wenn eine App mit beiden Optionen konfiguriert ist.<br /><strong>Betroffene Richtlinien: {0} </strong><br />Weitere Informationen: <a href='https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/security/cors' target='_blank'>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/security/cors</a>."

